Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:55.74,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:55.74,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}阿朗戈 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 大威廉姆斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,That's Emiliana Arango
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿朗戈就这样进了第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,into the second round in Cincinnati
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在辛辛那提 生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,for the first time in her career, taking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,而她要面对的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:10.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on one of the true greats of the sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这项运动真正的传奇之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Venus Williams not able to find the kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,大威廉姆斯今天没能打出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,of level she'd have liked today, but you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,她想要的水平 但你必须
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:20.24,EN,,0,0,0,,have to give all credit to the Colombian
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:20.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,把功劳全给这位哥伦比亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,who did exactly what she needed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,她把该做的事做得一丝不苟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,A real clarity around her game plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,战术非常清晰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and an impressive execution of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,执行得也非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:33.88,EN,,0,0,0,,62 62
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,六比二 六比二
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Emiliana, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃米利亚娜 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,We are all so curious to know what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都特别想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,that experience was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是一种什么样的体验
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,She won her first Grand Slam title
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,她拿下第一个大满贯的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.96,EN,,0,0,0,,a few months before you were born
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,离你出生还有几个月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是二〇〇〇年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, so to play a legend like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟这样一位传奇交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,that has to be pretty special for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你来说一定很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely. It felt so surreal like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实 感觉太不真实了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.04,EN,,0,0,0,,when the draw came out and I saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,签表出来我一看到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I was like, "Oh man.", it's so exciting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,就想 天哪 太兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to get to have this opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,居然有这样的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, growing up, I always saw her on TV
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从小就在电视上看她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and now getting to play her is is really crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在真的跟她打上了 太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What were you focusing on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天主要在专注什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's so much to it emotionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,情绪上要面对的东西很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,but as far as your game,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但就打法而言
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,you looked so strong out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天在场上非常强硬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:13.60,EN,,0,0,0,,What were you paying the most attention
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的计划里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to in terms of your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,最看重的是哪一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 是我的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I like my coach told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我教练跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I do not want to see you moving slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不想看到你移动变慢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,The only thing I want is for legs to go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只要一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,for your legs to go fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是你的腿快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:26.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I tried to focus as much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:26.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我尽可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,as I could on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,把注意力放在这上面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Try to get as many balls back as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽量多把球救回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:31.68,EN,,0,0,0,,And I I think I did a good job of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这一点我做得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,We love having you here in Cincinnati.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能来辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,You have such an incredible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的故事很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,We know you're a family girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们知道你很看重家人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Your family invested in your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的家人为你的职业投入很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, and you are here now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你现在站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,so proud playing some of the best tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,打着生涯最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,让人非常自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,What have you enjoyed here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,在辛辛那提 除了网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in Cincinnati outside of tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有什么让你觉得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,随便说说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely the golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,肯定是高尔夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been well my coach loves the golf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我教练特别喜欢高尔夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and the tournament does such a great job
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛事这方面做得特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:56.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of like letting us play
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们去打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and giving us some clubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还给我们配了球杆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and so my coach was out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我教练就跑去打了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,He's like let's go play some golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,他说 走 打高尔夫去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,The thing is he's really good and I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,问题是他打得特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,am not that good so it really pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我不行 所以真的很气人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, last quick question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后一个小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,We love the trademark backwards hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都喜欢你标志性的反戴帽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,What started this tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个习惯是怎么来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, my mom I my when I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的 是我妈妈 我小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,was younger, my hair wouldn't grow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,头发长不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and I would like always have it down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我总是把头发披着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and I would put on the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后戴上帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,But then my coach, which is funny enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我教练 说来也巧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,same coach I have here, he was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是我现在这个教练 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.84,EN,,0,0,0,,"Nobody plays like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,没人这样打球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You got to put your hair up in a bun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得把头发盘起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,or like in a ponytail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者扎个马尾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Do something with your hair." And
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之得弄一下 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,so my mom was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我妈妈就说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,"Why don't you braid it?" And
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,要不给你编个辫子 于是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,so she would braid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,她就给我编了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:40.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And then I was like, "Okay, and what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我说 好 那我的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,do I do with my hat?" And she goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么办 她说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,"Why don't you just put it backwards?" So,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,那你就反着戴呗 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was 10 years old and I've kept it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,那年我十岁 一直戴着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:47.60,EN,,0,0,0,,since.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,再没换过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, I don't think I can take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在我觉得我改不回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,来 大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Impossible not to love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁能不喜欢她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:55.74,EN,,0,0,0,,That is Emiliana Arango.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是埃米利亚娜·阿朗戈
